{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRFT a silly, whacky drifting roguelike where you control a car that should not be controlled! Bouncing from walls, maintaining control all while frantically shooting at chasing enemies! Upgrade over-the-top weapons that wreck havoc to anything in their path and go even crazier when you drift around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/gameplay_header.png?t=1749554232\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/banner_gif.gif?t=1749554232\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Braking is for losers!, steer left and right and use the walls to bounce around!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple two button drifting controls</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Drifting empowers you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/drft_state_gif.gif?t=1749554232\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When drifting you reach the empowered<strong> <i>DRFT State</i></strong>\u00a0where your weapons go bananas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay empowered for a short duration and mow through enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get back to drifting to recharge yourself!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/banner_gif_02.gif?t=1749554232\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Criss Cross Upgrading</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades can be applied to all weapons and overlap across all of them!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep clearing waves to gain as many upgrades as possible</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 120 upgrades to collect</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/extras/banner_upgrades.gif?t=1749554232\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 weapons, each with unique attacks and utility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ upgrades for weapons to create overpowered builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">endless waves of increasing difficulty and fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15+ Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968670?t=1749554232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2968670?t=1749554232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/cf327dd9f5f360d96287f3ba5a0bd0a0aaedf21e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749554232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968670/cf327dd9f5f360d96287f3ba5a0bd0a0aaedf21e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749554232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRFT a silly, whacky drifting roguelike where you control a car that should not be controlled! Bouncing from walls, maintaining control all while frantically shooting at chasing